    "body": "The reason for this is `blob:` and `data:` URLs and such. <s>I also don't think that RFC 3986 necessarily allowed this for all URLs (URL schemes could \"forbid\" the question mark for instance), whereas it does make special mention of same-document references.</s>\r\n\r\nEdit: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3986#section-5.2.2 seems to allow for this.",
